    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead yourself to victory in your own tank. You thought that you need the entire crew to drive such a vehicle? Then you were right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But not in this game! You have to switch between seats inside the tank in order to win. It is not a super realistic simulator but a casual game based on historical equipment. Put your multitasking to the test by trying to complete the tasks of up to 5 crew members just by yourself. Simultaneously drive, navigate, aim, load and look around - and most importantly - survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>There is also a two-player co-op mode.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Choose ammunition!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139290/extras/3cc8de98255c57e3452e948af2631465.poster.avif?t=1752181781\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139290/extras/3cc8de98255c57e3452e948af2631465.webm?t=1752181781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139290/extras/3cc8de98255c57e3452e948af2631465.mp4?t=1752181781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Blow up your opponents!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139290/extras/9486811246fa6de12ff5948130524adc.poster.avif?t=1752181781\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139290/extras/9486811246fa6de12ff5948130524adc.webm?t=1752181781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139290/extras/9486811246fa6de12ff5948130524adc.mp4?t=1752181781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achieve victory in four different tanks on dedicated maps:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Sd. Kfz. 222</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 3 crew members</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 20mm main cannon with a magazine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> coaxial machine gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> four wheeler</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>T-34-85</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 5 crew members</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> main gun 85mm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> coaxial machine gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> bow machine gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> armour-piercing and high explosive ammunition</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>M4A2 (76) W HVSS</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 5 crew members</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> main 76mm gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> coaxial machine gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> bow machine gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> armour-piercing and high explosive ammunition</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Tiger I</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 5 crew members</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> main 88mm gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> coaxial machine gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> bow machine gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> armour-piercing and high explosive ammunition</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead yourself to victory in your own tank. You thought that you need the entire crew to drive such a vehicle? Then you were right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But not in this game! You have to switch between seats inside the tank in order to win. It is not a super realistic simulator but a casual game based on historical equipment. Put your multitasking to the test by trying to complete the tasks of up to 5 crew members just by yourself. Simultaneously drive, navigate, aim, load and look around - and most importantly - survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>There is also a two-player co-op mode.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Choose ammunition!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139290/extras/3cc8de98255c57e3452e948af2631465.poster.avif?t=1752181781\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139290/extras/3cc8de98255c57e3452e948af2631465.webm?t=1752181781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139290/extras/3cc8de98255c57e3452e948af2631465.mp4?t=1752181781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Blow up your opponents!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139290/extras/9486811246fa6de12ff5948130524adc.poster.avif?t=1752181781\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139290/extras/9486811246fa6de12ff5948130524adc.webm?t=1752181781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139290/extras/9486811246fa6de12ff5948130524adc.mp4?t=1752181781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achieve victory in four different tanks on dedicated maps:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Sd. Kfz. 222</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 3 crew members</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 20mm main cannon with a magazine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> coaxial machine gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> four wheeler</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>T-34-85</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 5 crew members</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> main gun 85mm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> coaxial machine gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> bow machine gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> armour-piercing and high explosive ammunition</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>M4A2 (76) W HVSS</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 5 crew members</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> main 76mm gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> coaxial machine gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> bow machine gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> armour-piercing and high explosive ammunition</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Tiger I</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 5 crew members</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> main 88mm gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> coaxial machine gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> bow machine gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> armour-piercing and high explosive ammunition</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "One Tank Army is a game in which your goal is to defeat everyone from inside of the tank, changing places at the same time. Use the main gun as well as additional machine guns to clear the battlefield from enemies. There is also a two-player co-op mode.",
